# Absolute origin for canonical URLs, Open Graph tags and the sitemap.
# Set this to the deployed origin. Leave unset locally: the app then falls back
# to http://localhost:3000 so a dev build never emits links to a placeholder host.
#
#   Vercel .vercel.app subdomain:  https://<your-project>.vercel.app
#   Custom domain:                https://your-domain.com
#
# Do not commit a real value if you prefer to keep the deploy URL private; Vercel
# environment variables are the better home for it.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.com